  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How can I change my business start date?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 17 May, 2021 at  2:05 PM\n\nNavigation: My Admin > My Firm > Clients\n\nHelp/Guide \n\nPlease head to you client list in My Admin\n\nClick on the blue pencil button seen below\n\nOnce in the client area, click on the purple pencil next to edit client\n\nA pop up will appear. Please proceed to change the business start date\n\nPlease click save at the bottom of the pop-up\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
