splay: inline !important;\">My Admin &gt; My Firm &gt; Clients</span></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accountant/settings/firm.aspx?id=355195\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span></p><p><u><br></u></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Help/Guide</strong></span></u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong><u> </u></strong></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Please head to you client list in <em>My Admin</em></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click on the blue pencil button seen below</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9129820335/original/8tfGQK6XLXsyI8SLms2WashCWt3PsVYLmA.png?1621256419\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9129820335\"></strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once in the client area, click on the purple pencil next to edit client</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9129820649/original/eAy1zmSO_eUaY-jDk74dVNRK0Dqr-AnJOw.png?1621256574\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9129820649\"></strong></span><br></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A pop up will appear. Please proceed to change the business start date</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9129818768/original/SR28EIlIm7zlulEeZ83_If0Oi3jawWX